  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/94a3ba98fe537b71a0cedca8cdf679aea0668b950fa8b6ddc2ea6c6e99a6adff.png] \n\n1. ÷ and - \n\n18 + 72 - 12 × __**36 ÷ 12**__ = 132\n\n⇒ 18 + 72 - __**12 × 3**__ = 132\n\n⇒ __**18 + 72**__ - 36 = 132\n\n⇒ __**90 - 36**__ = 132\n\n⇒ 54 ≠ 132\n\n2. × and ÷\n\n18 + 72 × __**12 ÷ 36**__ - 12 = 132\n\n⇒ 18 + __**72 **____**×**____** 0.34**__ - 12 = 132\n\n⇒ __**18 + 24**__ - 12 = 132\n\n⇒ __**42**____** - 12**__ = 132\n\n⇒ 30 ≠ 132\n\n3. + and -\n\n18 - __**72 ÷ 12**__ × 36 + 12 = 132 \n\n⇒ 18 - __**6 × 36**__ + 12 = 132 \n\n⇒ __**18**__ - 216 __**+ 12**__ = 132 \n\n⇒ __**30 - 216**__ = 132 \n\n⇒ -186 ≠ 132\n\n4. × and +\n\n18 × __**72 ÷ 12**__ + 36 - 12 = 132\n\n⇒ __**18 × **__**__6__ **+ 36 - 12 = 132\n\n⇒ __**108 + 36**__ - 12 = 132\n\n⇒ __**144 - 12**__ = 132\n\n⇒ 132 = 132\n\nHence, ‘**× and +**’ is the correct answer.",
